suckless tools
==============

This repository contains local builds of several suckless tools.

Included tools
--------------
- `dmenu`: dynamic menu for X.
- `dwm`: dynamic window manager for X.
- `slstatus`: status monitor for dwm and other EWMH-compatible window managers.
- `slock`: simple X display locker.
- `st`: simple terminal emulator for X.

Build
-----
Each tool is built from its own directory:

    cd dmenu
    make

To install a tool globally, run the usual suckless install target from that
tool directory:

    sudo make clean install

Configuration
-------------
Most suckless tools are configured by editing `config.h` or `config.def.h` and
rebuilding.

Generated build outputs are ignored by the repository `.gitignore`.
